    "implementationStatus": "draft-only-not-loaded-by-runtime",
    "numericScope": "All gameplay numbers including inherited GDD values and new combat coefficients are [가설]; schemaVersion and identifiers are format metadata.",
    "aggregation": "For percent domains, validate existing vassal individual caps, sum eligible vassal + hero growth + passive + active skill + research values, then clamp once; preserve historical absent-block paths. Speed duration=ceil(baseSeconds/(1+cappedBonusPercent/100)), not baseSeconds*(1-bonus). Storage finalSeconds=min(18000,max(mapBaseOrBranchStorageSeconds,legacyEffectELowerBoundSeconds)+researchStorageSeconds); storage cap includes base time, not only research bonuses.",
    "effectTiming": "run/march effects snapshot at dispatch; job-speed effects snapshot at job start; one hero cannot occupy multiple active marches/runs",
    "skillActivation": "automatic; no new combat button; starts on cooldown; radiusMeters is measured from the controlled hero for trigger detection and recipient selection. maxTargets limits effect recipients, not detected enemies/objectives: controlled-hero effects target self only (1); standing-allies-in-radius selects up to maxTargets standing allies. Select nearest eligible recipients with stable entityId tie-break at activation; recipient must remain in radius for the radius-bound effect, no mid-duration replacement. One instance per skill, no stacking; duration expires without permanent stat mutation.",
    "heroParity": "All three level1/promotion0 baseCombat budgets are equal. Rarity never raises base coefficients or cap. This file does not define higher-level progression.",
    "researchScope": "Only level1 values included; no research-speed node, extra queue, troop-capacity increase or retroactive production. Legacy Research E and completed-node ledgers remain separate.",
    "troopConservation": "O=sum(R+D+W+Q)<=C; S=N-K; A=min(floor(K*injuryPercent/100),availableBeds); L=K-A; N=S+A+L; temporary summons never enter standing roster",
